@page
@model KopiCinta.Pages.CintaDariHulukeHilirModel
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Cinta Dari Hulu ke Hilir";
}

<section class="section">
    <div class="container">

        <div class="back-top reveal">
            <a asp-page="/Community">← Back</a>
        </div>

        <!-- HERO -->
        <div class="kbi-hero reveal">
            <div class="kbi-hero-text">
                <p class="eyebrow">Community & Outreach</p>
                <h2>Cinta Dari Hulu ke Hilir</h2>
                <p>
                    Growing beyond the cup — a journey of learning, confidence,
                    and opportunity for the Deaf community.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="kbi-slider" data-kbi-slider>
                <img src="/images/CintaDariHuluKeHilir/hulu-hilir1.jpg" class="kbi-slide active" alt="Cinta Dari Hulu ke Hilir 1">
                <img src="/images/CintaDariHuluKeHilir/hulu-hilir2.jpg" class="kbi-slide" alt="Cinta Dari Hulu ke Hilir 2">
                <img src="/images/CintaDariHuluKeHilir/hulu-hilir8.jpg" class="kbi-slide" alt="Cinta Dari Hulu ke Hilir 3">
                <img src="/images/CintaDariHuluKeHilir/hulu-hilir4.jpg" class="kbi-slide" alt="Cinta Dari Hulu ke Hilir 4">

                <button type="button" class="kbi-slide-btn prev" data-prev>‹</button>
                <button type="button" class="kbi-slide-btn next" data-next>›</button>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- INTRO -->
        <div class="detail-section reveal">
            <h3>Growing Beyond the Cup</h3>
            <p>
                For us, coffee is not just about what is served in a cup.
                There is a long journey behind it — and a greater potential
                within every individual involved.
            </p>
            <p>
                Through <em>Cinta dari Hulu ke Hilir</em>, we created a self-development
                project for the Deaf community, opening access to learning,
                growth, and opportunity. 
            </p>
        </div>

        <!-- SECTION 1 -->
        <div class="kbi-section reveal">
            <div class="kbi-img">
                <img src="/images/CintaDariHuluKeHilir/hulu-hilir5.jpg" alt="Building from within">
            </div>

            <div class="kbi-text">
                <h3>Building from Within</h3>
                <p>
                    This project begins with a simple purpose: to equip and develop skills.
                </p>
                <p>
                    Participants were introduced to various trainings and workshops,
                    ranging from entrepreneurship, public communication, photography,
                    basic ethics, to intensive barista training.
                </p>
                <p>
                    It was not only for the internal team, but also open to the wider Deaf community,
                    because access to learning should belong to everyone. 
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- SECTION 2 -->
        <div class="kbi-section reverse reveal">
            <div class="kbi-img">
                <img src="/images/CintaDariHuluKeHilir/hulu-hilir6.jpg" alt="Understanding coffee from the source">
            </div>

            <div class="kbi-text">
                <h3>Understanding Coffee from the Source</h3>
                <p>
                    The journey did not stop in the classroom.
                </p>
                <p>
                    Participants were brought closer to the origin of coffee,
                    learning the full process from planting and harvesting,
                    to post-harvest work, roasting, and understanding coffee varieties.
                </p>
                <p>
                    Step by step, they saw how everything eventually comes together
                    into a single cup of coffee. 
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- SECTION 3 -->
        <div class="kbi-section reveal">
            <div class="kbi-img">
                <img src="/images/CintaDariHuluKeHilir/hulu-hilir7.jpg" alt="From learning to mastering">
            </div>

            <div class="kbi-text">
                <h3>From Learning to Mastering</h3>
                <p>
                    After understanding the journey of coffee, participants continued
                    into the next stage: the barista course.
                </p>
                <p>
                    They learned from the fundamentals — techniques, machine use,
                    and more advanced processes such as calibration, cupping,
                    menu development, and quality control.
                </p>
                <p>
                    More than training, this project created opportunities:
                    a space to grow, build confidence, and carry meaningful skills into the future. 
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- ENDING -->
        <div class="hbii-ending reveal">
            <h3>Growing Together</h3>
            <p>
                For us, this journey is not only about the participants.
                It is a shared journey.
            </p>
            <p>
                Because when one person grows, the impact can reach many more.
                And from there, change begins — slowly, but meaningfully.
            </p>
        </div>
        <br />
        <div class="detail-back reveal">
            <a asp-page="/Community" class="btn btn-secondary">← Back to Community & Outreach</a>
        </div>

    </div>
</section>